Primary Key: `order_id`)\n","    *   **1-to-Many** relationship with **`order_items`** via `order_id`.\n","*   **`products`** (Primary Key: `product_id`)\n","    *   **1-to-Many** relationship with **`order_items`** via `product_id`.\n","*   **`order_items`** (Bridge table connecting products and orders)\n","    *   Contains foreign keys `order_id` and `product_id`.\n","\n","```\n","  [customers]\n","     │\n","     ├───────────┐\n","    1│          1│\n","     ▼           ▼\n","    *│          *│\n","  [orders]   [support_tickets]\n","     │\n","    1│\n","     ▼\n","    *│\n","[order_items] ◄── [products]\n","            *    1\n","```\n","\n","---\n","\n","### 2. Operational Origins & Business Context\n","\n","*   **`customers` & `orders`**:\n","    *   **Operational System:** Web Storefront / E-Commerce Platform (e.g., Shopify, WooCommerce, Magento).\n","    *   **Business Context:** Generated when customers create retail store accounts, manage their billing/shipping profiles, and check out transactions.\n","*   **`order_items`**:\n","    *   **Operational System:** Order Management System (OMS) / Transaction Database.\n","    *   **Business Context:** Captures precise transaction details including quantities purchased and historical prices active at the checkout moment.\n","*   **`products`**:\n","    *   **Operational System:** Product Information Management (PIM) or ERP Catalog Module.\n","    *   **Business Context:** Maintained by the inventory and marketing departments to represent product pricing, descriptions, stock configurations, and master definitions.\n","*   **`support_tickets`**:\n","    *   **Operational System:** Customer Service Help Desk Platform (e.g., Zendesk, Salesforce Service Cloud).\n","    *   **Business Context:** Logged when users contact support for help, delivery queries, order cancellations, or returns."]}]}